    "summary": "One Harpy per turn can use **[Spore Mine Cysts](vsdata:ability/tyranids.harpy.spore-mine-cysts)** when the [Fight phase](vsdata:core-rule/fight-phase) ends. Choose a visible enemy within 24″ of the Harpy, excluding **[Lone Operatives](vsdata:core-ability/lone-operative)**. Roll six D6 and deal 1 **[mortal wound](vsdata:core-rule/mortal-wounds)** to that enemy per 3+. As an alternative, add a unit of D3 **SPORE MINES** within 6″ of the Harpy, staying more than 8″ horizontally from every enemy unit.",
